{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q2659931","formula":"C₂₆H₄₅NO₇S","hill":"C26H45NO7S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":26.0,"H":45.0,"N":1.0,"O":7.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Taurocholic acid","ru":"Таурохолевая кислота"},"descriptions":{"en":"Taurocholic acid, known also as cholaic acid, cholyltaurine, or acidum cholatauricum, is a deliquescent yellowish crystalline bile acid involved in the emulsification of fats. It occurs as a sodium salt in the bile of mammals. It is a conjugate of cholic acid with taurine.","ru":"Таурохолевая кислота — одна из жёлчных кислот. Эмпирическая формула C26H45NO7S. Находится в жёлчи многих животных. Получить её в чистом виде довольно трудно, потому что она находится обыкновенно в смеси с гликохолевой кислотой; только в жёлчи собаки и питона примеси гликохолевой кислоты нет."},"fame":18,"pubchemCid":6675,"mass":515.7,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@H](CCC(=O)NCCS(=O)(=O)O)[C@H]1CC[C@@H]2[C@@]1([C@H](C[C@H]3[C@H]2[C@@H](C[C@H]4[C@@]3(CC[C@H](C4)O)C)O)O)C","inchikey":"WBWWGRHZICKQGZ-HZAMXZRMSA-N","iupac":"2-[[(4R)-4-[(3R,5S,7R,8R,9S,10S,12S,13R,14S,17R)-3,7,12-trihydroxy-10,13-dimethyl-2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9,11,12,14,15,16,17-tetradecahydro-1H-cyclopenta[a]phenanthren-17-yl]pentanoyl]amino]ethanesulfonic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"6675","atoms":80,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-6.638,"y":2.606,"z":-0.094,"el":"S"},{"x":1.094,"y":-0.904,"z":-2.064,"el":"O"},{"x":2.458,"y":2.259,"z":1.209,"el":"O"},{"x":5.863,"y":3.2,"z":-2.264,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.806,"y":-1.998,"z":0.579,"el":"O"},{"x":-7.304,"y":3.495,"z":1.1,"el":"O"},{"x":-7.07,"y":3.142,"z":-1.372,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.233,"y":2.399,"z":0.207,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.861,"y":-0.269,"z":-0.971,"el":"N"},{"x":0.78,"y":-1.643,"z":0.265,"el":"C"},{"x":1.162,"y":-0.281,"z"